{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-categorical-laplace-three-contexts","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:categorical-laplace-three-contexts","kind":"remark","title":"The categorical Laplace transform across $\\mathbb{F}_p$, $\\mathbb{Q}_p$, $\\mathbb{C}_p$","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-laplace","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-q-exp-finite-field-obstruction","papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-q-exp-p-adic"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-laplace","tags":["hopf-algebra","grouplike","laplace","p-adic","finite-field"],"text":"categorical-laplace-three-contexts.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"rem:categorical-laplace-three-contexts\"></a>\n<strong>Remark.</strong> <em>The categorical Laplace transform across <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{F}_p</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{Q}_p</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{C}_p</code></em></p>\n<p>Over <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{F}_p</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{L}</code> becomes a finite sum over the grouplike spectrum. Over <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{Q}_p</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{L}</code> is a continuous functional on locally constant functions. Over <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbb{C}_p</code>, <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathcal{L}</code> extends to rigid-analytic functions on the open disc.</p>\n"}
